# ===========================================================================
# Mini-R1 .gitattributes
# ===========================================================================
#
# GIT LFS IS DELIBERATELY NOT ENABLED FOR MODEL WEIGHTS BY DEFAULT.
#
# Why: the recommended distribution channel for this project's checkpoints is
# GitHub Releases, not Git LFS.
#
#   Final checkpoint (Model H)            485.3 MB
#   Optional comparison (Model G)         485.3 MB
#   Optional base pretrained              485.3 MB
#   Optional Task 20 init                 163.8 MB
#
#   GitHub LFS free tier: 1 GB storage AND 1 GB/month bandwidth.
#   The final checkpoint alone consumes ~48% of storage, and TWO clones in a
#   month exhaust the bandwidth quota. Adding Model G as well would exceed
#   storage on the first push.
#
#   GitHub Releases: 2 GB per file, no LFS quota consumed, no bandwidth
#   metering. Strictly better for immutable, versioned model artifacts.
#
# See README.md "Downloading the model" and reports/github_repository_audit.md.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IF you decide to use LFS anyway (e.g. on GitHub Enterprise with a larger
# quota), uncomment ONLY the specific release paths below. Do NOT uncomment a
# blanket `*.pt` rule — that would sweep in all 126 checkpoints (54 GB).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# artifacts/sft/task23_75_25/best.pt  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# artifacts/sft/task23_90_10/best.pt  filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings — this repo was authored on Windows and will be read on Linux.
# Normalise text in the index, leave binaries alone.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto

*.py     text diff=python
*.md     text
*.txt    text
*.json   text
*.jsonl  text
*.yaml   text
*.yml    text
*.cfg    text
*.ini    text
*.html   text
*.css    text
*.js     text
*.sh     text eol=lf
*.ps1    text eol=crlf

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Binary — never diff, never normalise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.model  binary
*.bin    binary
*.pt     binary
*.pth    binary
*.ckpt   binary
*.safetensors binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.gz     binary
*.zip    binary

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub language statistics: stop generated data/reports dominating the
# language bar so the repo reads as a Python project.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/**       linguist-generated=true
logs/**       linguist-generated=true
reports/*.json linguist-generated=true
